<title>USA: Hooper Holmes names CEO McNamee as chairman.</title>
<headline>Hooper Holmes names CEO McNamee as chairman.</headline>
<dateline>BASKING RIDGE, N.J. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hooper Holmes Inc said on Thursday that its board has elected President and Chief Executive James McNamee to the additional post of Chairman of the Board.</p>
<p>McNamee succeeds Frederick King, who passed away earlier this year.</p>
